WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
For shift triage, begin in All Tickets with the Open scope selected.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:08.910
Use the high-priority shortcut to isolate priorities zero and one.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.810
Add Unassigned to see only urgent work without a primary owner.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:18.110
An empty list means nothing matches both conditions, not that there are no urgent tickets.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.190
Clear the filters to restore the queue.
